-- Tests of circular תשפ"ו/1 against the Hours of Work and Rest Law
-- (MMS-678; the card trip-units-overtime). It prints the reform's table of
-- §40(ב) of the completion agreement to the owners' teachers: 4.5 units for
-- a day out ending between 21:00 and 24:00 and 6.5 for a night away, each
-- 0.7% of the monthly combined salary of a full position. Measured against
-- what the law asks for the worked days (l4/lib/escort-day.l4), at the
-- bound most generous to the employer (convention
-- instruments.regular-hour-wage): the units fall short on the day out to
-- 23:00, and on the night away even with the night left out. The circular
-- is the status quo the card is graded by (the corpus repo's decision 17).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `escort-day`
IMPORT `2025-26_tashpo_01`

§ `בדיקות חוזר תשפ"ו/1 מול חוק שעות עבודה ומנוחה`

-- What a trip pays, in hours of a month of 195: the circular's own rule
-- for the allowance, on a month of one shekel an hour.
GIVEN k IS A `trip kind`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `regular hours circular תשפ"ו/1's units pay, at most` k IS
    `trip allowance` k `the most hours a month of section 3's longest week holds`

`circular תשפ"ו/1's units pay less than the law asks for a day out to 23:00 and for a night away` MEANS
        `the instrument pays less than the Hours of Work and Rest Law asks`
            (`regular hours section 16 asks for an escort day` 8 23)
            (`regular hours circular תשפ"ו/1's units pay, at most` (`ending at an hour` 23))
    AND `the instrument pays less than the Hours of Work and Rest Law asks`
            (`regular hours section 16 asks for the worked night away` FALSE)
            (`regular hours circular תשפ"ו/1's units pay, at most` `activity with an overnight stay`)
#ASSERT `circular תשפ"ו/1's units pay less than the law asks for a day out to 23:00 and for a night away`

#ASSERT `regular hours circular תשפ"ו/1's units pay, at most` (`ending at an hour` 23) EQUALS 6.1425
#ASSERT `regular hours circular תשפ"ו/1's units pay, at most` `activity with an overnight stay` EQUALS 8.8725

§ `Property checks`

-- The circular over finite spaces, section by section (MMS-452). They sit
-- here, beside the module, because the circulars' root imports it: names of
-- the checks' own stay out of the root's reach.

`both booleans of תשפ"ו/1` MEANS LIST TRUE, FALSE
`positions checked of תשפ"ו/1` MEANS LIST 0, 0.25, 1 DIVIDED BY 3, 0.4, 0.5, 0.79, 0.8, 0.9, 1
`hundredths to 1 of תשפ"ו/1` MEANS map (GIVEN k YIELD k DIVIDED BY 100) (range 0 100)
`every week kind of תשפ"ו/1` MEANS LIST `primary special-education week`, `secondary special-education week`
`every school kind of תשפ"ו/1` MEANS LIST `primary special-education school`, `multi-stage special-education school`, `secondary special-education school`
`every deputy table of תשפ"ו/1` MEANS LIST `the principal's hours table`, `the primary first deputy's table`, `the secondary first deputy's table`, `the multi-stage first deputy's table`
`every step table of תשפ"ו/1` MEANS LIST `the certified academics' steps`, `the certified non-academics' steps`, `the academic managers' steps`, `the non-academic managers' steps`

GIVEN old IS A BOOLEAN, a IS A BOOLEAN, c IS A BOOLEAN, s IS A NUMBER, f IS A NUMBER, h IS A BOOLEAN, i IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `teacher`
DECIDE `a checked תשפ"ו/1 teacher` old a c s f h i IS
    `teacher` WITH
        `has prior recognised teaching seniority` IS old
        `academic`                IS a
        `certified to teach`      IS c
        `seniority in years`      IS s
        `position fraction`       IS f
        `health profession`       IS h
        `intern`                  IS i

-- §3 over every flag, position and seniority 20 to 30: an existing teacher
-- joins exactly as a certified academic from a third or a non-academic
-- from 28 years; one who may not be promoted is exactly uncertified below
-- 25; an existing academic of 25 years and more is promoted as certified.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN old YIELD
                all (GIVEN a YIELD
                        all (GIVEN c YIELD
                                all (GIVEN f YIELD
                                        all (GIVEN s YIELD
                                                LET t MEANS `a checked תשפ"ו/1 teacher` old a c s f FALSE FALSE
                                                IN      `joins Ofek Hadash` t EQUALS (old AND (IF a THEN c AND f AT LEAST 1 DIVIDED BY 3 ELSE s AT LEAST 28))
                                                    AND `an uncertified teacher may not be promoted` t EQUALS ((NOT c) AND s LESS THAN 25)
                                                    AND `promoted as a certified academic without certification` t EQUALS (a AND old AND s AT LEAST 25))
                                            (range 20 30))
                                    `positions checked of תשפ"ו/1`)
                            `both booleans of תשפ"ו/1`)
                    `both booleans of תשפ"ו/1`)
            `both booleans of תשפ"ו/1`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN y YIELD
                all (GIVEN d YIELD `the intern may stay on reform terms` y d EQUALS (y AT MOST 2 OR d)) `both booleans of תשפ"ו/1`)
            (range 0 4)
#ASSERT all (GIVEN r YIELD
                all (GIVEN w YIELD `the substitute is on reform terms` r w EQUALS (r AND w)) `both booleans of תשפ"ו/1`)
            `both booleans of תשפ"ו/1`

-- §4 over every school and grade: the primary week exactly in a primary
-- school and in grades 1-6 of a multi-stage one; every week 36 hours, at
-- most 26 frontal; a part week the full week's share, and its meeting hours
-- too.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN s YIELD
                all (GIVEN g YIELD
                        (`the work week` s g EQUALS `primary special-education week`)
                        EQUALS (s EQUALS `primary special-education school` OR (s EQUALS `multi-stage special-education school` AND g AT MOST 6)))
                    (range 1 12))
            `every school kind of תשפ"ו/1`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN k YIELD
                all (GIVEN f YIELD
                            `hours of the week` (`the part-time week` (`the teacher's week` k) f) EQUALS 36 TIMES f
                        AND `hours of the week` (`the part-time week` (`the therapist's week` k) f) EQUALS 36 TIMES f
                        AND (`the teacher's week` k)'s `frontal hours` AT MOST 26
                        AND `the meeting hours at most in a part-time week` k f AT MOST `the meeting hours at most in` k)
                    `positions checked of תשפ"ו/1`)
            `every week kind of תשפ"ו/1`

-- §5 over every teacher and both years: the minimum position is nothing
-- for the health professions, a third for an existing teacher or an
-- intern, and 80% for a new one from התשפ"ה (70% before); 5.5 permits
-- exactly up to two schools and 100%, or an exception; a period counts
-- exactly from a third.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN old YIELD
                all (GIVEN h YIELD
                        all (GIVEN i YIELD
                                LET t MEANS `a checked תשפ"ו/1 teacher` old TRUE TRUE 10 1 h i
                                IN      `the minimum position` t 2025 EQUALS (IF h THEN 0 ELSE IF old OR i THEN 1 DIVIDED BY 3 ELSE 0.8)
                                    AND `the minimum position` t 2023 AT MOST `the minimum position` t 2025
                                    AND all (GIVEN n YIELD
                                                all (GIVEN v YIELD
                                                        all (GIVEN x YIELD `5.5 permits the employment` t n v x EQUALS (h OR x OR (n AT MOST 2 AND v AT MOST 1))) `both booleans of תשפ"ו/1`)
                                                    (map (GIVEN k YIELD k DIVIDED BY 20) (range 10 24)))
                                            (range 1 4))
                            `both booleans of תשפ"ו/1`)
                    `both booleans of תשפ"ו/1`)
            `both booleans of תשפ"ו/1`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN f YIELD `the period counts towards the minimum period for promotion` f EQUALS (f AT LEAST 1 DIVIDED BY 3)) `positions checked of תשפ"ו/1`

-- §6 over managers, institutions, positions, weeks and days: nothing within
-- a full position; above it never a manager, beyond 42 hours or 8.5 a day;
-- the principal approves in one institution; across several, no request to
-- 106% and a request above.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN m YIELD
                all (GIVEN n YIELD
                        all (GIVEN v YIELD
                                all (GIVEN w YIELD
                                        all (GIVEN d YIELD
                                                LET r MEANS `what employment beyond 100% needs` m n v w d
                                                IN      (r EQUALS `none beyond the rule`) EQUALS (v AT MOST 1)
                                                    AND ((v AT MOST 1) OR (r EQUALS `not permitted`) EQUALS (m OR w GREATER THAN 42 OR d GREATER THAN 8.5))
                                                    AND ((r EQUALS `a request in the entitlements system`) IMPLIES (n GREATER THAN 1 AND v GREATER THAN 1.06)))
                                            (LIST 8, 8.5, 9))
                                    (range 38 44))
                            (map (GIVEN k YIELD k DIVIDED BY 100) (range 95 125)))
                    (range 1 3))
            `both booleans of תשפ"ו/1`

-- §7 over positions in hundredths: the nursing hours from 90% within four
-- months, a mother's hours from 79% otherwise; both clauses only at
-- exactly 90% (finding); never more than five hours off.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN f YIELD
                all (GIVEN w YIELD
                        LET r MEANS `the mother's reduction` f w
                        IN      (r EQUALS `nursing hours`) EQUALS (w AND f AT LEAST 0.9)
                            AND (r EQUALS `a mother's hours`) EQUALS ((NOT (w AND f AT LEAST 0.9)) AND f AT LEAST 0.79)
                            AND `weekly hours reduced` r AT MOST 5
                            AND (`7.3 gives nursing hours` f w AND `7.4 gives a mother's hours` f w) EQUALS (w AND f EQUALS 0.9))
                    `both booleans of תשפ"ו/1`)
            `hundredths to 1 of תשפ"ו/1`

-- §8 over ages 40 to 70: the hours off are 0, 2 or 4, never fewer for an
-- older teacher nor more for a new one, and one the printed bands give;
-- two different bases only for an existing teacher of 55 (finding; a new
-- one of 55 is in two bands that give one base).
#ASSERT all (GIVEN n YIELD
                all (GIVEN ex YIELD
                            elem (`age hours off` n ex) (LIST 0, 2, 4)
                        AND `age hours off` n ex AT MOST `age hours off` (n PLUS 1) ex
                        AND `age hours off` n FALSE AT MOST `age hours off` n TRUE
                        AND (count (nub (map (GIVEN b YIELD b's `position base after`) (`the bands for` n ex))) EQUALS 2) EQUALS (ex AND n EQUALS 55)
                        AND ((n LESS THAN 50) OR elem (`age hours off` n ex) (map (GIVEN b YIELD b's `frontal hours off` PLUS b's `individual hours off`) (`the bands for` n ex))))
                    `both booleans of תשפ"ו/1`)
            (range 40 70)

-- §9 over index levels 0 to 10: the level is 3 to 8, the minimum before a
-- new school's December computation; every table never more hours at a
-- higher level; a principal's hours off 0, 2 or 4; the non-academic
-- principal's degree within four years exactly from 1 to 27 years.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN l YIELD
                    `the complexity level` l AT LEAST 3 AND `the complexity level` l AT MOST 8
                AND `the complexity level in force` TRUE FALSE l EQUALS 3
                AND `the complexity level in force` FALSE FALSE l EQUALS `the complexity level` l)
            (range 0 10)
#ASSERT all (GIVEN t YIELD
                all (GIVEN l YIELD `the frontal hours at level` (l PLUS 1) t AT MOST `the frontal hours at level` l t) (range 3 7))
            `every deputy table of תשפ"ו/1`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN m YIELD
                all (GIVEN n YIELD elem (`a principal's non-frontal hours off` m n) (LIST 0, 2, 4)) (range 40 65))
            `both booleans of תשפ"ו/1`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN s YIELD `the non-academic principal must complete a degree within four years` s EQUALS (s AT LEAST 1 AND s AT MOST 27)) (range 0 32)

-- §10 over hours, hours already allotted and values: the pay never covers
-- more than 40 hours a year, at 125%; the stay hour's ordinary pay too,
-- but where the activity replaces it that day.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN w YIELD
                all (GIVEN h YIELD
                        all (GIVEN al YIELD
                                    `pay for school activity` w 100 h al AT MOST 125 TIMES max 0 (40 MINUS al)
                                AND `pay for school activity` w 100 h al AT MOST 125 TIMES h
                                AND `pay for school activity` w 100 h al AT LEAST 0)
                            (LIST 0, 20, 39, 40, 45))
                    (range 0 12))
            (LIST `on the teacher's day off`, `instead of a stay hour that day`, `instead of a stay hour worked another day`, `outside the working hours`)
#ASSERT `the stay hour's ordinary pay is also paid` `on the teacher's day off` AND NOT `the stay hour's ordinary pay is also paid` `instead of a stay hour that day`

-- §§11-13 over reasons, periods and steps: a request heard only on the form
-- and a recognised reason; the internship and compulsory service never
-- count; promotion needs the evaluation and both requirements; a
-- non-academic step never asks less than the academic one.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN r YIELD
                all (GIVEN fm YIELD `a request to leave may be considered` r fm EQUALS (fm AND NOT r EQUALS `another reason`)) `both booleans of תשפ"ו/1`)
            (LIST `health with current medical proof`, `humanitarian change for the worse after joining`, `another reason`)
#ASSERT all (GIVEN ex YIELD
                    NOT `counts as recognised seniority` `internship` ex
                AND NOT `counts as recognised seniority` `compulsory army service` ex
                AND `counts as recognised seniority` `recognised for salary before joining` ex EQUALS ex)
            `both booleans of תשפ"ו/1`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN t YIELD
                all (GIVEN st YIELD
                        all (GIVEN mo YIELD
                                all (GIVEN h YIELD
                                            NOT `may be promoted` mo (50 TIMES h) FALSE st
                                        AND `may be promoted` mo (50 TIMES h) TRUE st EQUALS (mo AT LEAST st's `months required` AND 50 TIMES h AT LEAST st's `development hours required`))
                                    (range 0 10))
                            (map (GIVEN k YIELD 6 TIMES k) (range 0 10)))
                    t)
            `every step table of תשפ"ו/1`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN p YIELD
                all (GIVEN q YIELD
                        (NOT p's `from grade` EQUALS q's `from grade`)
                        OR (q's `months required` AT LEAST p's `months required` AND q's `development hours required` AT LEAST p's `development hours required`))
                    `the certified non-academics' steps`)
            `the certified academics' steps`

-- §14 over positions and hours: a counsellor teaches at least 4 frontal
-- hours; the allowance exactly from 7 counselling hours, more with a
-- permanent licence.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN f YIELD
                all (GIVEN p YIELD `a counsellor's minimum frontal teaching` f p AT LEAST 4) `both booleans of תשפ"ו/1`)
            `positions checked of תשפ"ו/1`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN h YIELD
                    (`the counselling allowance rate` h FALSE GREATER THAN 0) EQUALS (h AT LEAST 7)
                AND `the counselling allowance rate` h FALSE AT MOST `the counselling allowance rate` h TRUE)
            (range 0 12)

-- §15 over grades, mentors, roles and salaries: a conversion sets exactly
-- whole and half grades; a mentor's rate never above three interns'; the
-- rate that governs never below the circular's; at most two allowances
-- paid, never more than the two highest; every allowance with a minimum
-- never below it.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN k YIELD `a grade the conversion may set` (k DIVIDED BY 4) EQUALS (FLOOR (k DIVIDED BY 2) TIMES 2 EQUALS k)) (range 4 36)
#ASSERT all (GIVEN n YIELD
                    `the role allowance rate` (`mentor` n) AT MOST 0.072
                AND `the role allowance rate that governs` (`mentor` n) AT LEAST `the role allowance rate` (`mentor` n))
            (range 0 8)
#ASSERT `role allowances paid` (LIST `second deputy principal`, `class educator`, `laboratory coordinator`, `trips coordinator`) EQUALS 0.3
#ASSERT all (GIVEN c YIELD
                all (GIVEN r YIELD
                        `the role allowance with its minimum` r c AT LEAST (IF r EQUALS `class education` OR r EQUALS `first-grade class education` THEN 1000 ELSE 1100))
                    (LIST `class education`, `first-grade class education`, `grade coordination up to 4 classes`, `grade coordination above 4 classes`, `junior-division management up to 4 classes`, `junior-division management above 4 classes`, `deputy`))
            (map (GIVEN k YIELD 1000 TIMES k) (range 0 20))
#ASSERT all (GIVEN t YIELD elem (`the special-education allowance rate` (IF t THEN `not certified, in special education` ELSE `not certified`)) (`the rates for an uncertified teacher` t))
            `both booleans of תשפ"ו/1`

-- §16 over ending hours 0 to 24 in halves: the units never fall with a
-- later end, from 0 to 4.5; the rewarded and substitute hours never above
-- the activity's.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN k YIELD
                LET e MEANS k DIVIDED BY 2
                IN      `trip units` (`ending at an hour` e) AT MOST `trip units` (`ending at an hour` (e PLUS 0.5))
                    AND `trip units` (`ending at an hour` e) AT MOST 4.5)
            (range 0 47)
#ASSERT all (GIVEN p YIELD
                all (GIVEN a YIELD
                            `substitute hours for a trip` p a AT MOST a
                        AND `substitute hours for a trip` p a AT MOST max 0 (7 MINUS p)
                        AND `trip hours that may be rewarded` a p AT MOST a)
                    (range 0 12))
            (range 0 9)

-- §17 over every group and share: the advance rate is 12% to 20% where set;
-- the advance never falls with a larger share.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN g YIELD
                CONSIDER `the advance rate` g
                WHEN JUST r THEN r AT LEAST 0.12 AND r AT MOST 0.2
                WHEN NOTHING THEN g EQUALS `non-academic first deputy` OR g EQUALS `non-academic principal`)
            (LIST `teacher or intern in primary or grades 1-6`, `teacher or intern in secondary or grades 7 and up`, `academic first deputy`, `academic principal`, `non-academic first deputy`, `non-academic principal`)
#ASSERT all (GIVEN q YIELD `the Ofek Hadash advance` 0.14 10000 (q DIVIDED BY 4) AT MOST `the Ofek Hadash advance` 0.14 10000 ((q PLUS 1) DIVIDED BY 4)) (range 0 4)

-- §18 over clock-ins from 6:00 to 9:00 in quarters: time never counts
-- before 7:45, and from the clock-in after it.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN k YIELD
                LET t MEANS k DIVIDED BY 4
                IN `working time counts from` t AT LEAST 7.75 AND (`working time counts from` t EQUALS t) EQUALS (t AT LEAST 7.75))
            (range 24 36)
#ASSERT all (GIVEN c YIELD all (GIVEN a YIELD `the governing answer` c a EQUALS a) (range 0 5)) (range 0 5)
